<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Gen Z Luv</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Central Cee</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Gen Z Luv</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">13hJUmR1UpCUzyHjotiImK</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.030" end="00:02.070">When our children ask us how did we meet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.070" end="00:06.250">I'm telling them "Gen Z love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.250" end="00:12.920">FYP love, IG love"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.920" end="00:14.520">My crisis ain't from cost of living</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.520" end="00:16.180">I think 'bout death like God forbid it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.180" end="00:17.690">American Express got no limit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.690" end="00:19.200">Career consists of lots of women</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.200" end="00:20.830">How can I convince you I'm not the villain?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.830" end="00:22.460">Shit's dramatic like opera singing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.460" end="00:24.060">Down on one knee, I got a proposition</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.060" end="00:25.690">In the past, I was not consistent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.690" end="00:27.220">Out of these girls you're top division</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.220" end="00:28.880">Can't downgrade and lower my standard</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.880" end="00:30.680">Went I first saw you on the gram bae</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.680" end="00:32.180">I was in awe and showing the mandem</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.060" end="00:33.730">Asking advice, how can I slide in there?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.730" end="00:35.230">Using words not my usual language</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.140" end="00:36.940">I clocked that you just came out of a break-up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.940" end="00:38.570">Been on your social media ranting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.570" end="00:40.070">Slid up and replied to your story</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.050" end="00:42.490">You ain't responded I wanna unsend it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.490" end="00:43.990">Got me stalking your Facebook page</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.980" end="00:45.480">And preying your friends list</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.030" end="00:46.560">Saw that you followed a fellow acquaintance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.560" end="00:48.300">You ain't even mine, yet I'm feeling envious</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.300" end="00:50.070">Promiscuous chick make me wanna risk it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.070" end="00:51.680">I like how you're real uncensored</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.680" end="00:53.210">When our children ask us how did we meet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.210" end="00:54.710">I'm telling them "Gen Z love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.570" end="00:56.100">FYP love, IG love"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.100" end="00:57.600">Saw her on the explore page</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.550" end="00:59.050">Like I need to, explore deeper</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.040" end="01:01.050">Suggested accounts said that we got mutuals</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.050" end="01:02.570">But you don't fuck with them, me neither</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.570" end="01:04.070">When I'm with you, I get baby fever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.970" end="01:05.740">I met your mum on the FYP</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.740" end="01:07.240">We're young and our love's Gen Z</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.170" end="01:09.070">Mum said that it ain't gon' last</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.070" end="01:10.570">I'm telling her "We gon' see"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.380" end="01:12.230">They say our relationship is childish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.230" end="01:13.730">You're my baby, so I agree</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.730" end="01:15.280">Started with a IG like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.280" end="01:17.160">Now you're down to ride just like a G</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.160" end="01:18.660">If it weren't for the algorithm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.620" end="01:20.270">I wouldn't have found my woman</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.270" end="01:21.920">We're messing around and acting like kids</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.920" end="01:23.660">Give me a nostalgic feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.660" end="01:25.160">Took you on all of 'em trips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.000" end="01:26.670">Now you got my account untrippin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.670" end="01:28.170">Sent you a thousand roses</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.930" end="01:30.060">Not like you're local, a thousand of miles I've driven</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.060" end="01:31.560">You ain't even gave me the ick yet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.360" end="01:33.110">I ain't even seen red flags yet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.110" end="01:34.610">Get mad 'n you call me a dickhead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.590" end="01:36.330">Got me addicted, feel like a crackhead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.330" end="01:37.830">Passenger seat, just giving me side-eye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.720" end="01:39.370">It's giving main character syndrome</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.370" end="01:40.920">You ain't got to connect to the Wi-Fi</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.920" end="01:42.730">Let's just talk and put down our iPhones</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.730" end="01:44.230">She like my post, I like her post</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.140" end="01:45.640">Love at first sight, love at first row</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.530" end="01:47.390">I ain't perfect, I'm tryna learn though</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.390" end="01:48.890">Hope it's worth it when we turn old</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.790" end="01:50.290">Still recovering, I'm not okay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.290" end="01:51.960">So I'm paranoid that she won't stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.960" end="01:53.660">I'ma catch you wine, this a soul train</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.660" end="01:55.160">I'm afraid this ain't like the old days</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.130" end="01:57.240">When our children ask us how did we meet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.240" end="01:58.740">I'm telling them "Gen Z love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.340" end="01:59.840">FYP love, IG love"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.820" end="02:01.670">Saw her on the explore page</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.670" end="02:03.280">Like I need to, explore deeper</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.280" end="02:05.000">Suggested accounts said that we got mutuals</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.000" end="02:06.540">But you don't fuck with them, me neither</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.540" end="02:08.040">When I'm with you I get baby fever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.000" end="02:09.670">I met your mum on the FYP</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.670" end="02:11.370">We're young and our love's Gen Z</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.370" end="02:12.970">Mum said that it ain't gon' last</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.970" end="02:14.470">I'm telling her "We gon' see"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.470" end="02:16.230">They say our relationship is childish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.230" end="02:17.730">You're my baby, so I agree</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.700" end="02:19.330">Started with a IG like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.330" end="02:20.830">Now you're down to ride just like a G</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.700" end="02:24.700" /></div></body></tt>